    "explanation": "Maintains the logical clock, active lease, expiration, and monotonic generation in opaque state. Advance increases time before expiration; all other operations expire an overdue lease first. Acquisition increments generation only when vacant. Renewal requires the current owner and generation and replaces the deadline from the current time. Release clears only a matching active lease.",
    "program": "function solve({config,state,event}){let s=state||{now:0,owner:null,generation:0,expires:null},t=s.now,o=s.owner,g=s.generation,x=s.expires,L=config.ttl,status;if(event.type==='advance'){t+=event.dt;if(o!==null&&x<=t){o=null;x=null}status='advanced'}else{if(o!==null&&x<=t){o=null;x=null}status='ignored';if(event.type==='acquire'){if(o===null){g++;o=event.owner;x=t+L;status='acquired'}else status='busy'}else if(event.type==='renew'){if(o!==null&&o===event.owner&&g===event.generation){x=t+L;status='renewed'}}else if(event.type==='release'){if(o!==null&&o===event.owner&&g===event.generation){o=null;x=null;status='released'}}}let next={now:t,owner:o,generation:g,expires:x};return{state:next,output:{status:status,owner:o,generation:g,expires:x,now:t}}}"
